ind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.10 - Bug Fixes & QOL","summary":"Bug Fixes & QoLAfter Turtle's spin attack, clients sometimes remained in an \"ice walking\" state.Players could move in the lobby.Spectators could not hear each other, and living players heard dead players heavily distorted.The ship was very unstable and players could end up outside of it.Players left outside the ship did not count as \"dead\", so no money was deducted for reviving.Rain did not work.Optimized rain on Low or Medium graphics settings","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:04:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032011","verified_at":"2026-10-22T15:01:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1846651706691460","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"Project Exodus is Live at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Steam Next Fest is already here, and the Project Exodus demo is waiting for you!If you haven't tried the game yet, now is the perfect time to gather your squad, descend into the abandoned facilities on Earth, and see if you have what it takes to survive and meet the quota.For those who have already been playing over the past few weeks, we have a very important update for the demo. We've listened to your feedback and completely changed what happens when you finish your expedition: your save file ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1846018067935868","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.8 - General Changes, Fixes & Balancing","summary":"New ContentShop:Item icons are now displayed in the cart.Enemies:Turtle:New footstep sounds.New patrolling sounds.New tired sound.Sonic Monster:New footstep sounds.New sleeping sound.New waking up sound.Nimbus:Ultimate attack now makes all lights on the map flicker.Ark:Basketball hoop now has a score counter.Added a basketball.UI:New loading screen.ChangesArtifacts:Broken Radio: More time between \"dialogues\".Items:Items can now be resold for half their price.Player:Enemy Scanner: Only nearby ene","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1845383656395933","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"Project Exodus Demo is Now Available! Play Free","summary":"The time has finally come! You can now download and play the official demo for Project Exodus.Get ready for a first-person co-op horror experience where simply running away isn't enough. Gather your team, explore the dark corridors of the two available maps: the Warehouse and Sr. Reginald's Manor, and use your tactical gear to hunt down the creatures lurking in the dark.You will need to coordinate and use your arsenal of capture nets to trap the monsters, extract their biomass to meet your quota","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:26:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395933","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1845383656395913","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out!! Fix & Balancing","summary":"New ContentArk:Added basketball hoop.Warehouse:Added procedural trees outside.ChangesMinibot:Improved voice effects.Nets:Each net type now has its own grenade (different colors).Improved net rope effect.Bug FixesSensitivity did not change instantly.Flare Gun did not work for clients.Improved FPS on low-to-mid range PCs.Reduced RAM consumption.General optimizations.Major optimization in Sr. Reginald's Manor.The tutorial started on page 4.Player footsteps in the garage and inside the Armory could ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:16:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395913","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1845383656385957","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.6 - Balanceo y Corrección de Errores","summary":"New ContentOptions:You can now choose the audio playback device.ChangesArtifacts:Soccer Ball:Improved physics.Bug FixesImproved physics for trapped enemies.Exiting the ship while the door was opening caused instant death.Net Launcher info remained on the top right of the screen even after being deselected.Some texts displayed incorrectly in the Map Selector in certain languages.The ship's blind did not open again after dying in solo mode.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T11:24:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385957","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1844751498229343","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.5 - General Fixes and Remodeling","summary":"New ContentUI:A new cursor icon for all interfaces has been added.ChangesItems:Pistol:3D model changed.Icon changed.Flare Gun:3D model changed.Icon changed.Bug FixesWater level did not rise during rainy weather.Bullets did not affect stunned enemies.Sonic Monster dealt damage through walls.Sonic Monster attacked through walls.Sonic Monster passed through some walls.Flight mode could be entered using the \"V\" key.Turtle gas affected explosive mines.A mansion room had a hole in it.Menu buttons were","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T14:56:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229343","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1844751498227843","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.4 - Minibot Utility, Fix & QA","summary":"New ContentUI:Added tooltips/item information when holding an object in your hand.Minibot:Can now shoot a straight laser beam that stuns and deals damage to both enemies and players.Bug FixesPlayer upgrades now have textures.Optimized RAM and reduced disk space usage.Whisper's whispers did not play in the correct position when caught.Changed Nimbus's sounds.Nimbus did not execute its ultimate attack correctly.General texture bug fixes.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T18:45:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1844751498220631","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.3 - New Quick Tutorial, Fix & Balancing","summary":"New ContentTutorial:Added a small tablet tutorial with slides.This tutorial is given to each player at the start of the match.BalancingEnemies:Sonic Monster (Bat):The sonic wave now affects other enemies.Increased sonic wave damage (15 -> 25).Increased melee attack damage (25 -> 75).Bug FixesWhisper no longer gets stuck on the Warehouse stairs.Improved visibility of the hologram text on the ship.You can no longer fall into the void in the Ark right at the start of the match.Items in the Ark now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T08:33:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1844115010504053","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.2 - Fix & Balancing","summary":"BalancingArtifacts:Flask: Increased value (\\ -> \\).Biohazard Paper: Increased value (\\ -> \\).Eye: Increased value (\\ -> \\).Maps:Laboratory:Reduced artifact spawn count (\\ -> \\).Reduced artifact multiplier per extra player (x1.75/player -> x1.5/player).Bug FixesOptimized both game install size (2.32 GB -> 1.82 GB) and RAM usage (~20% reduction).Fixed new flashlight icons not showing up in the shop.Optimized the Laboratory map.Fixed an issue where the ship ramp remained closed on client side.Fixed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T12:25:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1844115010499169","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug fixes","summary":"Bug FixesThe water in the mansion was missing its texture.Upgrade names were not translated in the menu.You wouldn't die if the ship left while you were outside.A water gun spawned by default in the ship.Nimbus moved erratically for clients.Some animations were not showing on clients.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T15:48:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499169","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1844115010498893","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.6.0 - Malevolent Manor","summary":"New ContentMaps:Sr. Reginald’s Manor:Rework of the Mansion map, now named \"Sr. Reginald's Manor\".Added procedural basement.Added a river surrounding the manor.Added a cabin near the entrance.Added a new ladder system.Main Menu:Added a new \"Credits\" section.Items:Water Gun: Used to condense Nimbus so it can be trapped.Water Grenade: Used to condense Nimbus so it can be trapped.General:Added light switches to turn map lights on and off.Space Ship:Ship lights now kill Whisper.Ship lights can now be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:15:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498893","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1840944183786242","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.5.0 - Warehouse Armed","summary":"New ContentMaps:Warehouse:Rework of the Warehouse or \"Armory\" map. It is mainly visual, but I have also added many new gameplay areas and adjusted the old ones to make it feel more claustrophobic.As for the garage, it keeps the same structure but now has more walls and obstacles that create blind spots and add to that claustrophobia. You will no longer be able to see the entire garage at a glance like before.Animations:New grab animations for some items.Ship:Now you can see the selected map on a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T14:39:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786242","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1836506165560477","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"update","title":"v0.4.0 - The Fear Update","summary":"New ContentTRANSLATIONS TO OTHER LANGUAGESSpanish (Castellano).French.Italian.Simplified Chinese.German.Portuguese (Brazil).Japanese.Korean.Russian.Visual Effects:Added new visual effects.Enemies:Turtle:Added roar sounds (which also trigger a fear effect on the player).Roaring now attracts nearby enemies.Now roars when trapped as well.Sonic Monster:Added new animations.Audio:Added new sound effects to almost all enemies, items, and environments.Added unique footstep sounds for each surface type ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T15:40:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165560477","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1834602721196634","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.3.7 - Fix & Balancing","summary":"ChangesNet SystemIf an enemy manages to move far enough away, they will now pull the player forcefully to prevent being dragged to the ship.Nets are no longer launched instantly upon clicking. You must now hold and charge the net launcher before firing. The distance the net travels depends on how long you charge it (max 3 seconds).ArkFixed an issue where two Earths would appear in space.PlayerAdjusted close-range night vision so that using a flashlight indoors is no longer strictly necessary.Map","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T18:41:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721196634","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1834602721187041","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.3.6 - Fix & Balancing","summary":"ChangesWarehouseArtifacts now mostly spawn inside the building and the garage to encourage exploration.EnemiesWhisper: Can now only move within indoor areas.Turtle: Can now only spawn in indoor areas, but is able to move outdoors.Sonic Monster: Can now only spawn in indoor areas, but is able to move outdoors.BalancingMapsWarehouse:Increased first enemy spawn time: 45s -> 60s.Increased time between enemy spawns: (12s-20s) -> (17s-20s).Increased time between enemy spawns after dying: (10s-15s) -> ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T09:54:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721187041","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1834602721184931","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.3.5 - Fix & Gameplay Changes","summary":"New ContentWarehouse:Added background mountains for better ambiance.Map lights now kill Whisper.Player:Item weight now affects movement speed.Stamina now only decreases based on items equipped/carried on the head.Enemies:Each enemy now has a minimum level required to start spawning.ChangesWarehouse:Added a garage ventilation exhaust to increase visibility in the lower area of the map and more clearly show that a garage exists.Graphics:Night vision is now slightly more intense so playing without ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T14:07:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721184931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1833968530899932","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.3.4 - Minor Bug Fix","summary":"Changes:On the save selection screen, the days remaining to meet the quota are now displayed instead of the current day.Added low-quality shadows to the \"Low\" preset instead of disabling them completely.Bug Fixes:Fixed an issue where entering settings and clicking \"Back\" prevented you from opening settings again.Fixed a bug where changing maps in the map selector while the ship was moving didn't spend any money, allowing you to travel anywhere for free.Fixed an issue where the base Ship autonomy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T09:57:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1833968530897197","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"update","title":"v0.3.0 - The Weather Update","summary":"New ContentGeneral Systems:New Enemy Capture Mechanic: Now you can only catch one enemy at a time. You will have to drag them with physics to the ship. They can escape just like before, but now you will receive a detrimental effect if they do. You can release the rope with right-click and reattach a rope to the net with E while holding the net launcher in your hand. If you break the line of sight (for example, behind a wall) for more than 5 seconds, the rope will break.New Weather System: Now ea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T10:44:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530897197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4149590-1825093633194004","game_id":"steam-4149590","kind":"update","title":"v0.2.3 - The Ambient Update","summary":"New ContentWarehouse:Added ambient sounds.Added decorative elements (Trees, bushes, robots...).Added new lights inside.Added ambient music.Mansion:Added ambient sounds.Added decora